*  149 - Same bug shape as 119 with different OUTPUT messages.
*  Originally test 118 was meant to cover this, but 118 assigns
*  outer AFTER the match — *outer is unassigned at match time so
*  the FENCE machinery never runs and the test "passes" spuriously.
*  This test is what 118 was intended to be.
        cmd = FENCE('a' | 'ab')
        outer = ARBNO(*cmd)
        s = 'aab'
        s POS(0) *outer RPOS(0)                               :S(BAD)F(GOOD)
BAD     OUTPUT = 'should fail (seal violated)'                :(END)
GOOD    OUTPUT = 'arbno-star-cmd FENCE sealed'
END
